}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 实验题（I、II、III三题共14分，每空1分）\n16-I. (4分)(1)0.32m/s或0.33m/s，C (2)不通过；线性\n16-II. (7 分) (1)a (2)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{I}"},{"type":"text","value":"—"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"(3) 1.5V,"},{"type":"math","value":"1.0\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"(4) =, >(5)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n16-III. (3 分) (1) C (2) >, >"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a48e70377088b4bf26a1a61b4b044db1fd8165dd322ff235d04edb1884b6a433","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（8分）在一个电梯的轿厢中，一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"M = 10\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，内部横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 100\\mathrm{cm}^2"},{"type":"text","value":" 的气缸由一个质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 10\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞封闭了一定质量的理想气体。初始时（如图甲），气缸静置在轿厢底部，气柱高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_1 = 16\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。若用绳子连接活塞将气缸悬挂在电梯的顶部（如图乙），电梯以加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a = 2\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 匀加速上升。已知大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_0 = 1.0\\times 10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，轿厢内温度不变，气缸导热性能良好且不计活塞与气缸壁间的摩擦。\n（1）在加速状态下，待气柱稳定时，与初始时相比，封闭气体的分子平均动能（填空），单位体积内的分子数（填空）；（两空均选填“增加”、“减少”或“不变”）\n（2）求图甲静止状态下，气缸内气体的压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）求图乙加速状态下，气柱的最终高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2dc2f6c9970a3a2317d0fed35aa1f264ea89fbae03b11b974c3676abea9153d3.png","width":223,"height":270,"width_mm":26.127,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/fe94d1bef3bcdb19bf41fc341c3bee3885dc1bce964c3b29c74aee0d043f0faf.png","width":220,"height":270,"width_mm":25.759,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图\n乙\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. (8 分)\n解析：（1）不变，减少 （2 分）\n（2）初态静置时，由活塞平衡得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S + mg = p_{1}S"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=1.1\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）当加速上升时，对气缸建牛顿第二定律方程："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S-Mg-p_{2}S=Ma"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=8.8\\times10^{4}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由气体等温变化规律："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}Sh_{1}=p_{2}Sh_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=20cm"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"efb017960b44106b4eee00944ee45adeb22076418cb0a1b3ac40020a2b680f8f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）如图所示，一弹射游戏装置由安装在水平台面上的固定弹射器、水平直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 、圆心为 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 的竖直半圆轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 、水平直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成。 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最高点 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 的右端点 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 在同一竖直线上，且 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点略高于 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点。木板静止在 "},{"type":"math","value":"GH"},{"type":"text","value":" 上，其上表面与 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 相平，右端紧靠竖直边 "},{"type":"math","value":"FG"},{"type":"text","value":" ，左端固定一竖直弹性挡板。游戏时滑块从 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点弹出，经过轨道 AB、BCD、EF 后滑上木板。已知可视为质点的滑块质量 m=0.3kg，木板质量 M=0.1kg，长度 l=1m，BCD 的半径 R=0.4m，弹簧弹性势能的最大值为 8J，滑块与木板间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，木板与轨道 GH 间的动摩擦因数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其余各处均光滑，不考虑弹射过程中及滑块经过轨道连接处时的能量损失，滑块与挡板发生弹性碰撞。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0550a1f7aa312c974af010a169e02bbdb453c922216c28d102f878827fee498a.png","width":500,"height":289,"width_mm":58.693,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 18 题图\n（1）若滑块恰好能够滑上轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求滑到圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高处的 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时，滑块受到的弹力大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1} = 0.2"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则在满足滑块始终不脱离木板的条件下，求滑块在木板上的动能最大值 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\mathrm{km}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}=0,\\quad\\mu_{2}=0.1"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块恰好能够滑上轨道EF，求在滑块与挡板刚发生第2次碰撞前，摩擦力对木板做的功W。\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 g 均取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）\n解析：(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg = m \\frac{v_{D}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{c}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}+mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=m\\frac{v_{c}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=9N"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"mv=(m+M)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}mgx=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}(m+M)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{km}=\\frac{m+M}{M}\\mu_{1}mgx"},{"type":"text","value":"当 x=2l 时，"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{km}=4.8J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n此时"},{"type":"math","value":"v=4\\sqrt{2}m/s>2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"能够滑上木板，相应的弹性势能 7.2J<8J\n(3) 由题意知，滑块刚滑上木板时"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"滑块与挡板第1次碰撞"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{0}=mv_{1}+MV_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}MV_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得滑块速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}v_{0}=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"木板速度"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}=\\frac{3}{2}v_{0}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n经判断，发生第 2 次碰撞前，木板已处于静止状态。\n故摩擦力对木板做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=0-\\frac{1}{2}MV_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -0.45\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4940e0253b0d63b99fae467af1154fe9512f8ec85a42ea03b42776c5979dd360","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（11分）图甲为超导电动磁悬浮列车（EDS）的结构图，其简化图如图乙，超导磁体与“8”字形线圈之间通过互感产生电磁力将车体悬浮起来。如图丙所示，列车侧面安装的超导磁体产生垂直纸面向里的以虚线框为界的磁场，忽略边缘效应，磁感应强度大小恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，磁场的长和宽分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2l"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" 。在列车轨道两侧固定安装了“8”字形线圈，每个“8”字形线圈均用一根漆包线绕制而成，匝数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水平宽度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" ，竖直长度足够大，交叉的结点为 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 。当列车以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 匀速前进时\n（1）若磁场的中心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点与线圈结点 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高，求此时线圈中的电流大小；\n（2）若磁场的中心 O 点比线圈结点 P 低了 h 时 （"},{"type":"math","value":"h < \\frac{l}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，且保持不变），只考虑动生电动势\n①在磁场刚进入单个“8”字形线圈时，求线圈对列车阻力的瞬时功率；\n②在磁场穿越单个 “8” 字形线圈的过程中，画出单个 “8” 字形线圈对列车竖直方向的作用力与时间的关系图，取竖直向上为正方向，磁场刚进入线圈时 t=0。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/357b6d412b378cd5b3319761487446177eb8290f6a221bc647f887d402ed34a5.png","width":1181,"height":868,"width_mm":138.729,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第19题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（11分）\n解析：（1）从闭合回路来看，线圈上下部分形成的电动势大小相等，方向相反，总电动势为0，电流为0。（2分）\n(2) ①在磁场刚进入 “8” 字形线圈时, 由闭合电路欧姆定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"2nBhv = IR"},{"type":"text","value":"“8” 字形线圈此时受到的安培力"},{"type":"math","value":"F = 2nIhB"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{4n^{2}B^{2}h^{2}v}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n磁场受到大小相等方向相反的阻力："},{"type":"math","value":"F' = F"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n则阻力的瞬时功率"},{"type":"math","value":"P = -F'v = -\\frac{4n^{2}B^{2}h^{2}v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n②"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/28c406a74362b57df5fb13a1966c022418b755bbf7c98301395f3615f3c5799b.png","width":464,"height":380,"width_mm":58.8},{"type":"text","value":"(4 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411","source_question_id":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"35aec1857234d87470f65c6b1863af75f05dfc57858ae85ec200ecaf9e8753a9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）某同学用磁聚焦法测地球的磁感应强度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其装置如图甲所示，大量电子经前级电场加速到 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （图中未画），通过筛网后互相平行地沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正向进入偏转区，偏转区上下两极板接 "},{"type":"math","value":"u = U_{0}\\cos \\omega t"},{"type":"text","value":" 的交流电压（ "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 足够大），两平行极板间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" ，长度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"l"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子在偏转区中运动时间极短，在此过程中可认为电场不变。紧接偏转区右端，有一厚度不计且垂直于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中央有一小孔位于原点 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 。紧挨挡板右侧有一中轴线位于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上的螺线管。在螺线管内有一垂直于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的荧光屏，屏的中心在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴上且与原点相距 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知电子电荷量的绝对值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，穿过小孔的电子都能打到荧光屏上，不计电子的重力和相互间作用力，不考虑相对论效应和电场磁场的边缘效应，偏转区已屏蔽磁场。\n（1）求 t=0 时（上极板电势高）恰能经过挡板小孔的电子在筛网处的位置坐标；\n（2）当螺线管内总磁感应强度为0，求荧光屏上显示的光斑长度L；\n（3）当螺线管内部总磁感应强度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{\\pi mv_0}{3eh}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正向时，在图乙中大致画出电子在荧光屏打出的光斑形状并求出光斑上离荧光屏中心最远点的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"s"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n（4）螺线管电流的大小与电流在管内产生的磁感应强度大小的关系式为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{L}=kI"},{"type":"text","value":" （k为已知量）。现将装置的轴线与地磁方向平行放置，逐渐从零增大螺线管中的电流，当电流大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，第一次发现荧光屏上呈现一位于中心的亮点。改变电流方向并逐步从零增大，当电流大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，再次发现亮点。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}>I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"h<\\frac{2\\pi mv_{0}}{eB_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求此处地球磁感应强度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （用k、 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 来表示）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b720e836440bda39390cca23b21ad46741996ef4569d5ba368b8d52c9af3892e.png","width":425,"height":330,"width_mm":49.862,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ada63065f16e4884eae1a702a4e4b58759265783c9af81b0d2c6a4bfca5c19f9.png","width":464,"height":496,"width_mm":54.461,"row_group":"gaosan-huliqu-sandishi-2411-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第20题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20. (11 分)\n解析：（1）当转电压为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，进入偏转区的电子都向上偏转，偏移量"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}at^{2}=\\frac{eU_{0}l^{2}}{2mdv_{0}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"能穿过小孔的电子在筛网处的坐标位置应为："},{"type":"math","value":"(-l,-\\frac{eU_{0}l^{2}}{2mdv_{0}^{2}},0)"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（2）电子最大偏转角的正切值"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\theta = \\frac{at}{v_0} = \\frac{eU_0l}{mdv_0^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n则达到荧光屏上偏离中轴线的距离"},{"type":"math","value":"y_{\\mathrm{m}} = h\\tan \\theta = \\frac{eU_0lh}{mdv_0^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n故在荧光屏上呈现的光斑为一条平行于"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{y}"},{"type":"text","value":"轴的亮线，其长度"},{"type":"math","value":"L = 2y_{\\mathrm{m}} = \\frac{2eU_0lh}{mdv_0^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(3)由所有电子在磁场中做螺旋运动的周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi m}{eB}=\\frac{6h}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":",\n到达荧光屏的时间都是"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{h}{v_0} = \\frac{T}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"沿 x 负向看，所有粒子都沿逆时针转过"},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"圆弧后达到荧光屏上，光斑形状如图。（2 分）\n电子在 y 方向上最大速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{ym} = \\frac{eU_{0}l}{mdv_{0}}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5b735149a97f3af34de303f3a0e4bcaf22785042ce3d37b990c9927b4df5ce3f.png","width":458,"height":443,"width_mm":58},{"type":"text","value":"电子最大的螺旋半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r_m = \\frac{mv_{ym}}{eB} = \\frac{3eU_0hl}{\\pi mdv_0^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"光斑上离荧光屏中心最远点的距离等于在 yoz 平面投影的圆弧弦长，即"},{"type":"math","value":"s=r_{m}=\\frac{mv_{ym}}{eB}=\\frac{3eU_{0}hl}{\\pi mdv_{0}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n(4) 由"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1} + B_{0} = B_{2} - B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}=\\frac{B_{2}-B_{1}}{2}=\\frac{k(I_{2}-I_{1})}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）"}]}}]}
